Cambridge University Press (CUP) Template Inspiration
-----------------------------------------------------
The layout and formatting principles of this Typst template were inspired by
the official LaTeX templates provided by Cambridge University Press (CUP),
specifically the "Cambridge Medium" template available on Overleaf
(https://www.overleaf.com/latex/templates/cambridge-medium-template-class-file/zshzqdxjjqkq).
The original CUP template is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International (CC BY 4.0) by Cambridge University Press and Overleaf .
No source code from the CUP template was copied; only general structural
concepts were referenced.

JIKO (Jurnal Informatika dan Komputer) Formatting Guidelines
------------------------------------------------------------
This template is designed to produce manuscripts that conform to the
author guidelines of JIKO (Jurnal Informatika dan Komputer), published by
Universitas Teknologi Digital Indonesia (UTDI). The official JIKO LaTeX
template (available at https://ejournal.utdi.ac.id/index.php/jiko) does not
specify an open-source license. This Typst template is an independent
implementation of those formatting guidelines and is not officially
affiliated with or endorsed by JIKO or UTDI.
